# REST Client examples of the redacted Copilot bridge envelope.
# These are server ingress payloads, not native Copilot hook stdin.
# Copy the local server's port and token from ~/.pixel-agents/server.json.
# Use a tracked working directory, or enable Watch All Sessions.
@port = 3100
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_TOKEN
@cwd = /absolute/path/to/workspace
@session = manual-copilot-session

### Startup does not create an active character until actual activity arrives.
POST http://127.0.0.1:{{port}}/api/hooks/copilot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hook_event_name":"sessionStart","session_id":"{{session}}","cwd":"{{cwd}}"}

### Start a turn without sending prompt text.
POST http://127.0.0.1:{{port}}/api/hooks/copilot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hook_event_name":"userPromptSubmitted","session_id":"{{session}}","cwd":"{{cwd}}"}

### Start a tool with a basename-only activity label.
POST http://127.0.0.1:{{port}}/api/hooks/copilot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hook_event_name":"preToolUse","session_id":"{{session}}","cwd":"{{cwd}}","tool_name":"view","tool_use_id":"manual-tool","tool_input":{"path":"example.ts"}}

### Actual human permission prompt (not the pre-evaluation permissionRequest hook).
POST http://127.0.0.1:{{port}}/api/hooks/copilot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hook_event_name":"notification","session_id":"{{session}}","cwd":"{{cwd}}","notification_type":"permission_prompt"}

### Finish the tool without forwarding its result.
POST http://127.0.0.1:{{port}}/api/hooks/copilot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hook_event_name":"postToolUse","session_id":"{{session}}","cwd":"{{cwd}}","tool_name":"view","tool_use_id":"manual-tool"}

### Turn complete.
POST http://127.0.0.1:{{port}}/api/hooks/copilot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hook_event_name":"agentStop","session_id":"{{session}}","cwd":"{{cwd}}"}

### External enrolled CLI has exited.
POST http://127.0.0.1:{{port}}/api/hooks/copilot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hook_event_name":"sessionEnd","session_id":"{{session}}","cwd":"{{cwd}}","reason":"user_exit"}
